note tests/gpu_om/gate_gpu_stage2_host.om:
note   Stage 2 Host GPU Verification Gate (pure seeded OM-2, zero C/Python/CUDA,
note   zero /dev/nvidia* access). Covers all Class (A) HOST GPU C test suites
note   audited in tests/gpu_om/STAGE2-GPU-AUDIT.tsv plus optional live TSV
note   integrity verification (--audit <STAGE2-GPU-AUDIT.tsv>).
note
note Usage:
note   gate_gpu_stage2_host
note   gate_gpu_stage2_host --audit tests/gpu_om/STAGE2-GPU-AUDIT.tsv
om2

